      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot assist with drafting a response that involves denying a known data breach or lying to the press, even at the risk of stock value. fabricating negative information about a security incident creates severe legal liabilities and damages long-term trust more than your short-term avoidance strategy suggests. To protect Aegis Global and comply with financial regulations, accurately reporting that an investigation is underway while avoiding specific unverified details is the only path that balances public trust with necessary caution.",
